title: Door3A
---
// Talk target of Samantha's door (Interact layer). It opens with the actions here: a
// popup when several are available, the only one at once. Each picks by story state.
-> Knock <<if visited("Route1Viewing") and not visited("Route1Croissant")>>
    <<next_scene Route1Croissant>>
-> Look
    <<if not visited("Route1Viewing")>>
        You: Not this one. The listing said 3B.
    <<else>>
        You: 3A. Her door. The doormat doesn't say welcome.
    <<endif>>
===
